{"findings":[{"local_id":"migrate-lost-update","locations":[{"end_line":729,"path":"rust/fslc/src/main.rs","start_line":684},{"end_line":991,"path":"rust/fslc/src/main.rs","start_line":946}],"mechanism_tags":["check_write_gap","repeated_effect","state_transition_gap"],"rationale":"Migration output is computed from an earlier read, but the commit checks only that the target is a regular file. An editor or concurrent migration can change the file before rename, and that newer content is silently overwritten.","severity":"medium"},{"local_id":"migrate-rollback-discards-backups","locations":[{"end_line":999,"path":"rust/fslc/src/main.rs","start_line":990}],"mechanism_tags":["state_transition_gap","repeated_effect"],"rationale":"After a partial commit fails, restoration errors are ignored and every backup is then deleted. A failed restore therefore leaves a partially migrated source set while destroying the recovery copy.","severity":"high"},{"local_id":"literate-pid-symlink-overwrite","locations":[{"end_line":82,"path":"rust/fslc/src/main.rs","start_line":56}],"mechanism_tags":["unstable_token","check_write_gap","repeated_effect"],"rationale":"The materialization filename uses only the predictable process ID and is written without create-new or symlink checks. A pre-existing symlink at that path causes verification of a Markdown file to truncate any writable target before Drop removes the symlink.","severity":"high"}],"obligation_results":[{"disposition":"not_applicable","finding_local_ids":[],"packet_id":"benchmark-context:sha256:be1850bb4ce865bf84f62d9848758dde553c137232d8f71b47540e6b687b299f"},{"disposition":"inconclusive","finding_local_ids":[],"packet_id":"benchmark-context:sha256:48009112cd4f7bd72f95607b73d6188566e958c661585fd8c9d82f6502bdc199"},{"disposition":"issue_present","finding_local_ids":["migrate-lost-update"],"packet_id":"benchmark-context:sha256:c64561b51770256fdb8f270964e231e0265db51fd3a21bb2ac797188e00242b5"},{"disposition":"inconclusive","finding_local_ids":[],"packet_id":"benchmark-context:sha256:019a687b52bd5e1edbc0a68de7b21248799e959c8499992e110281906d68095f"},{"disposition":"issue_present","finding_local_ids":["migrate-lost-update","migrate-rollback-discards-backups","literate-pid-symlink-overwrite"],"packet_id":"benchmark-context:sha256:73480b49ae8caebb4d59fe5911e718426c96b61c996090afdb3ea79e4e9bc191"}],"outcome":"structured","schema":"reviewgraphen.benchmark.candidate_output.v1","trial_id":"m7-real:snapshot-14:g3_proxy:1"}